sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Utilisateur
    participant Agent as Agent
    participant STM as ShortTermMemory
    participant State as ConversationState
    participant Extractor as MemoryExtractor
    participant LTM as LongTermMemoryStore

    User->>Agent: Message
    Agent->>STM: add(user, message)
    Agent->>State: update intent / slots / status
    Agent->>Extractor: detect explicit stable preference
    alt Information mémorisable
        Extractor->>LTM: save preference or fact by user_id
    else Information temporaire ou sensible
        Extractor-->>Agent: do not persist
    end
    Agent->>STM: add(assistant, response)
    Agent-->>User: Réponse contextualisée
